{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52556","headline":"其四 · 陈元光","name":"其四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戍楼西北望皇家，夏永南征岭海赊。\n殿阁凉生梅浦雨，葵柳红映锦江霞。\n侮凌烽火心如水，变幻风云眼未花。\n犀照湖花消魍{鬼象}，龙呈剑气射虚邪。\n赤鸟黑马流红汗，绿柳金莺冒翠华。\n淬砺戈矛寻石上，沉浮瓜李戏江涯。\n蕙兰纫佩生香满，荷芰缝衫御暑嘉。\n较斧开林驱虎豹，施罟截港捕鱼虾。\n火田畲种无耕犊，阴隙戎潜起宿鸦。\n夜析重门防暴客，三更三点尚排衙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}